port devel/juce706
type port
reason "DragonFly: treat DragonFly as JUCE_BSD (dragonfly/@<line>, CRLF kept as in the sources)"

# JUCE 7.0.6 stops on "Unknown platform!". The dragonfly/@<line> patches
# define JUCE_BSD for __DragonFly__ and cover the VST3 SDK BSD section
# (FreeBSD's files/ patch), plain stat in Projucer's binary builder and
# kinfo_proc's kp_flags. Three of the files are CRLF; the patches keep it.
